com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/5206f5cb5943feb87c1aa4a9f0332834.poster.avif?t=1784130518\" width=480 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/5206f5cb5943feb87c1aa4a9f0332834.webm?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/5206f5cb5943feb87c1aa4a9f0332834.mp4?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perk System - The Burger Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All loot is important and its even more so when it comes to the Burger Shop. Certain loot can be brought to the inventory room in the Burger Shop and restocked on the Shelves to build progress toward game perks. As you fill the inventory higher and higher, you'll gain access to things like cooking burgers, brewing coffee, and even a Black Market Vendor that spawns randomly on planets each contract with extremely powerful weapons/utilities items.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking Burgers is just one of perks you can unlock. Consuming one of these instantly heals you to full then heal per second over 30 mins afterwards. Additionally all damage is increased by 10% for that duration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/8c68a446c6c6a1ae016bdf38ad82d28f.poster.avif?t=1784130518\" width=480 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/8c68a446c6c6a1ae016bdf38ad82d28f.webm?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/8c68a446c6c6a1ae016bdf38ad82d28f.mp4?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another perk is 30% discount from the Black Market Vendor who is a special NPC that appears randomly on different planets each contract based on planetary conditions. Everything sold here is pricey but powerful.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/f4cd9a266f221549d7ec70564eea1372.poster.avif?t=1784130518\" width=480 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/f4cd9a266f221549d7ec70564eea1372.webm?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/f4cd9a266f221549d7ec70564eea1372.mp4?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in mind though that Aliens will visit the Burger Shop as you play, consuming a small amount of your Shop inventory as they order food. You'll need to work hard for the Burger Shop if you want to keep all those fancy optional Perks. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/61b53ba03281dfdb633cac20f4527ef8.poster.avif?t=1784130518\" width=480 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/61b53ba03281dfdb633cac20f4527ef8.webm?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/61b53ba03281dfdb633cac20f4527ef8.mp4?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini Games and Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your complete contracts, you'll gain rewards in the form of credits, arcade coins and gotcha coins all which can be used to purchase new player skins, furniture to decorate your apartment and ship, as well as play mini games at the arcade. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/57f0232d41a0c630b0999f6b2b0a1f91.poster.avif?t=1784130518\" width=480 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/57f0232d41a0c630b0999f6b2b0a1f91.webm?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/57f0232d41a0c630b0999f6b2b0a1f91.mp4?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/c25be1f287da09f5d39514b0bfa1f8d0.poster.avif?t=1784130518\" width=480 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/c25be1f287da09f5d39514b0bfa1f8d0.webm?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/c25be1f287da09f5d39514b0bfa1f8d0.mp4?t=1784130518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate your space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your apartment with 100+ different unlockables and that's not to mention all the corpses you collected as trophies. There's even a loot convertor machine that allows you to convert collected loot into furniture so that you never lose them on a contract wipe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras/310c72b2b489c05e33ababde457f55ba.avif?t=1784130518\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/extras_big/310c72b2b489c05e33ababde457f55ba.webp?t=1784130518 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A 1-8 player co-op sci-fi looter horror game that takes place on a mysterious asteroid belt where players must complete contracts by traveling to exotic planets to kill creatures, find loot, and/or farm planetary materials that they must return to an ominous figure named Sketchy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/237f2443665c1e1c5722f7f68b65113b86fb2890/header.jpg?t=1784130518", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/fb8094e6d0d83526ef97dae16e209deaece9c2a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784130518", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823080/fb8094e6d0d83526ef97dae16e209deaece9c2a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784130518", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-2400 / AMD CPU with 4 physical cores @ 3Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB or AMD Radeon RX 470 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Internet connection required to play</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core